    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody Expects Exploding Immortal Pigeon is a 2D adventure side-scroller platformer where you play as an immortal pigeon with a rather explosive 'personality'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548770/extras/d2bad4b33d7d3ad8a5e16874de675a81.poster.avif?t=1744035508\" width=798 height=598 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548770/extras/d2bad4b33d7d3ad8a5e16874de675a81.webm?t=1744035508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548770/extras/d2bad4b33d7d3ad8a5e16874de675a81.mp4?t=1744035508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your one true goal? Eat as much bread as possible\u2014by any means necessary. Whether it\u2019s dive-bombing unsuspecting humans, sabotaging rival birds, or using creative destruction to clear obstacles, nothing will stand in the way of your carb-fueled obsession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548770/extras/cdeaa31645dd958472a8bf80de1780ce.poster.avif?t=1744035508\" width=798 height=598 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548770/extras/cdeaa31645dd958472a8bf80de1780ce.webm?t=1744035508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548770/extras/cdeaa31645dd958472a8bf80de1780ce.mp4?t=1744035508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With chaotic pigeon physics, unpredictable encounters, and plenty of feathered mayhem, this game delivers nonstop action and absurd fun. The world may not expect you\u2014but the bread is yours for the taking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548770/extras/d48ff61eb4e18546bcbaeb26df0c39ac.poster.avif?t=1744035508\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548770/extras/d48ff61eb4e18546bcbaeb26df0c39ac.webm?t=1744035508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody Expects Exploding Immortal Pigeon is a 2D adventure side-scroller platformer where you play as an immortal pigeon with a rather explosive 'personality'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548770/extras/d2bad4b33d7d3ad8a5e16874de675a81.poster.avif?t=1744035508\" width=798 height=598 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548770/extras/d2bad4b33d7d3ad8a5e16874de675a81.webm?t=1744035508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548770/extras/d2bad4b33d7d3ad8a5e16874de675a81.mp4?t=1744035508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your one true goal? Eat as much bread as possible\u2014by any means necessary. Whether it\u2019s dive-bombing unsuspecting humans, sabotaging rival birds, or using creative destruction to clear obstacles, nothing will stand in the way of your carb-fueled obsession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548770/extras/cdeaa31645dd958472a8bf80de1780ce.poster.avif?t=1744035508\" width=798 height=598 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548770/extras/cdeaa31645dd958472a8bf80de1780ce.webm?t=1744035508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548770/extras/cdeaa31645dd958472a8bf80de1780ce.mp4?t=1744035508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With chaotic pigeon physics, unpredictable encounters, and plenty of feathered mayhem, this game delivers nonstop action and absurd fun. The world may not expect you\u2014but the bread is yours for the taking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548770/extras/d48ff61eb4e18546bcbaeb26df0c39ac.poster.avif?t=1744035508\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548770/extras/d48ff61eb4e18546bcbaeb26df0c39ac.webm?t=1744035508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
